{
  "info": {
    "name": "Librería · evidencia JSON",
    "description": "Colección para evidencia del monorepo. Todas las APIs Flask usan ?format=json.\n\nOrden obligatorio de la carpeta 1 (Login):\n1. Índice HATEOAS\n2. Health\n3. Captcha\n4. Register (pide captcha solo y lo resuelve)\n5. Login sin verificar (403)\n6. Verify email\n7. Login cuenta nueva\n8. Session\n9. Extender sesión\n10. Logout\n11. Login admin ya verificado\n\nLuego corre 2. SOAP y 3. Node.\n\nEn Collection Runner activa Keep variable values y guarda el reporte HTML.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "login", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:5000" },
    { "key": "soap", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:5001" },
    { "key": "library", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000/library" },
    { "key": "captchaId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "captchaAnswer", "value": "" },
    { "key": "captchaQuestion", "value": "" },
    { "key": "verificationToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "registerEmail", "value": "postman.demo@example.com" },
    { "key": "registerPassword", "value": "ClaveSegura26" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "mariana.solis@libreriaonline.mx" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "LibreriaAdmin26" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
